d go see a patient, so I stopped at a truck stop and had the breakfast buffet, then went to the bathroom to poop and couldn't because of the eight bathroom stalls, one was occupied and all seven of the others had toilets whose seats had been visibly shat upon, and I didn't see anything like that during my trip to Belgium, and maybe I <i>will</i> just marry Belgium if I love it so much. My story of Kingdom City was about me eating rubbery scrambled eggs and having to drive to a different gas station to poop; someone contact the people at Oslo and tell them I'll accept my Nobel via satellite.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-21T09:42:11-08:00","id":54727,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/43901-slices-of-self-importance-jimb-s-essay-journal?p=54439#post54439\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">and I didn't see anything like that during my trip to Belgium, and maybe I <i>will</i> just marry Belgium if I love it so much.</div> </div> </div> </div>I expect to be invited to the wedding.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor